WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.306 --> 00:00:01.805
- So we're out here today in Hollywood

00:00:01.805 --> 00:00:04.182
trying to figure out what this thing is.

00:00:04.182 --> 00:00:06.270
Now, people are calling it a hoverboard,

00:00:06.270 --> 00:00:08.653
but it has wheels, so...

00:00:10.263 --> 00:00:11.105
What is this?

00:00:11.105 --> 00:00:13.600
Yeah, what up?

00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:15.945
Yeah, what is this thing I'm on right now?

00:00:15.945 --> 00:00:17.476
- What they call a hoverboard.

00:00:17.476 --> 00:00:19.846
- It's a, some kind of roller,

00:00:19.846 --> 00:00:22.169
a new electronic roller skate thing.

00:00:22.169 --> 00:00:22.650
- Nice.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:25.819
- Perhaps just like the movie.

00:00:25.819 --> 00:00:27.490
I'm from Brazil, in Brazil we call

00:00:27.490 --> 00:00:29.015
(speaking Portuguese)

00:00:29.015 --> 00:00:30.200
- Would you call it a hoverboard?

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:31.361
- No.
- Why?

00:00:32.891 --> 00:00:34.888
Why is it called a
hoverboard? It doesn't hover.

00:00:34.888 --> 00:00:36.246
- Yeah, I don't know.

00:00:37.306 --> 00:00:39.184
- Yo, what would you call this right here?

00:00:42.124 --> 00:00:42.532
Got it.

00:00:44.468 --> 00:00:46.284
You think this is the future?

00:00:46.284 --> 00:00:47.263
- I love it.

00:00:47.263 --> 00:00:49.042
- This? I hope not.

00:00:49.042 --> 00:00:51.344
- So, we're back at BuzzFeed

00:00:51.344 --> 00:00:53.385
and we didn't get any
answers on the street

00:00:53.385 --> 00:00:55.643
so let's see what people
say around the office.

00:00:57.053 --> 00:00:58.353
Yeah.

00:00:58.353 --> 00:01:00.559
Hey, what would you call this thing?

00:01:00.559 --> 00:01:01.558
- A hoverboard?

00:01:01.558 --> 00:01:02.393
- What is this?

00:01:02.393 --> 00:01:05.319
- That's like one of those
segway, hoverboard...

00:01:05.319 --> 00:01:06.759
No! Yes.

00:01:06.759 --> 00:01:08.361
- It's a segway that doesn't have

00:01:08.361 --> 00:01:09.730
a handle for your arms.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:11.192
- They're not actually hoverboards.

00:01:11.192 --> 00:01:13.887
That's, like, a complete ripoff.

00:01:13.887 --> 00:01:15.047
But they can call it a hoverboard.

00:01:15.047 --> 00:01:15.786
- Then what is it?

00:01:15.786 --> 00:01:17.647
- I don't know. It's like
some roly poly thing.

00:01:17.647 --> 00:01:19.367
- So here's what I learned guys.

00:01:19.367 --> 00:01:21.607
This could be called a roly poly,

00:01:21.607 --> 00:01:24.016
a segway without handles, or probably

00:01:24.016 --> 00:01:26.471
just an interesting way to get around.

00:01:26.471 --> 00:01:30.436
But all in all, it's just the future, man.

00:01:37.276 --> 00:01:41.355
- Um, a hoverboard with a wheel.

00:01:41.355 --> 00:01:43.374
- This is a hoverboard with a wheel?

00:01:43.374 --> 00:01:44.536
- (laughs) I don't know.

